          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu, tukwakula netwidi? AJentili, abulili kulondela mwaya kuloŋa, anatambuli dehi kuloŋa, kuloŋa kwokukukuhwelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinza aIsarela, alondelaŋa lushimbi lwakuloŋa, anabuli kushika kulushimbi ilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyi? Muloŋa chabuliluwu kulukeŋa nakukuhwelela, chiŋa nanyidimu hohu. Wena ahukeni kwilolodu dakuhukana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwomwanasonekuwu nawu, Tiyenu, ami hinukusha muZiyona ilola dakuhukana, nilwilola lwakudimbwisha; muntu wukumukuhwelela hiya kamutiyisha nsonyuku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.33"
            ]
          }
